WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.383
There are two main ways to inject guidance into
diffusion models: use an external trained classifier,

00:00:06.463 --> 00:00:10.670
or use classifier-free guidance that a single model
learns jointly.

00:00:10.750 --> 00:00:15.853
Both work well, but neither says anything about the
shape of the condition space.

00:00:15.933 --> 00:00:21.995
The authors' insight is that a text encoder maps
prompts into a continuous space with structure,

00:00:22.075 --> 00:00:25.707
and if you identify that structure, you can move along it.

00:00:25.787 --> 00:00:28.650
That motivates inner classifier-free guidance.
